        "content": "Ibyaha byanjye, Yesu Yarabyikoreye,W' atigeze gukora Icyaha na kimwe;\nNdamwegera, ndasenga, Nd' umunyabyaha pe, Nizer' ijambo ry' ati : Urababariwe !"
