        "type": "verse",
        "number": 1,
        "content": "Mwa ngabo z'Umwami mwe, muze,dutabare! dor'Umwami wacu yatugiy'imbere.yahuye n'abanzi be, abanesha bose. dor'ibender'iragiye.tuyikurikire."
