        "number": 1,
        "content": "b. \n\nNi mw’ ijuru ku Mana —Abizeye Bazateranirizwa— Mu mahirwe. Kubw’Umwuka w’ Umwami Bateraniyeyo.Bazerura ngo, Shimwa—Shimwa,Mwami!"
